      "text": "Requirements A bandit disciple is holding a pouch of fine sand.\n\n---\n\nEffect The disciple Strides. If they end their movement adjacent to an enemy, they can make a Deception check check against that enemy's Perception DC.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success As success, and the enemy also takes 1 extra precision damage.\n\nSuccess The enemy takes 1d4 fire damage and is Blinded for 1 round.\n\nFailure No effect.\n\nCritical Failure The bandit disciple drops their pouch of fine sand, spilling and rendering it useless."
